  "body": "### What problem are you trying to solve?\n\nI sure have lots of ideas for HTML. Here's another one I've got:\n`<spreadsheet>`\n\nThe syntax:\n`<spreadsheet rows=\"x\" cols=\"x\" alt=\"A spreadsheet.\"></spreadsheet>`\n\nWhat can you do?\n\nThe tag provides a spreadsheet that is very interactive. You can do:\n* Add rows and columns\n* Use equations for programming (\"`=A1+C8`\")\n* Make tables\nThere is also a property:\n`<spreadsheet noedit></spreadsheet>`\n\nIt makes a spreadsheet for display.\n\nDEFAULT VALUES:\nIf no values are specified, the default is:\n`<spreadsheet rows=\"5\" cols=\"5\"></spreadsheet>`\n\nAnd you can put preset values:\n\n`<spreadsheet rows=\"5\" cols=\"3\">\n       <cell location=\"A1\">This is in A1</cell>\n</spreadsheet>`",
